480 480w,        /images/en-us/ebdca16f-9c80-8ae7-dcaa-3b579364fcfc?format=
=3Djpeg&amp;w=3D640 640w,        /images/en-us/ebdca16f-9c80-8ae7-dcaa-3b57=
9364fcfc?format=3Djpeg&amp;w=3D800 800w" sizes=3D"(max-width: 480px) 320px,=
 (max-width: 768px) 480px, (max-width: 1024px) 640px, 800px"><img class=3D"=
fluentImage" src=3D"https://support.microsoft.com/images/en-us/ebdca16f-9c8=
0-8ae7-dcaa-3b579364fcfc" loading=3D"lazy" alt=3D"Command Prompt with admin=
istrator rights - command succeeded" width=3D"981" style=3D"aspect-ratio: 9=
81/513"></picture>
              </p>
              <p>
                <b class=3D"ocpLegacyBold">Step 2: Grant administrators ful=
l access to the corrupted system file.</b>
              </p>
              <p>Type the following command, and then press ENTER:</p>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"ocpUserInput">icacls &lt;Path_And_File_Name&=
gt; /grant administrators:F&nbsp;</span>
              </p>
              <p>Example:</p>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"ocpUserInput">icacls C:\windows\system32\jsc=
ript.dll /grant administrators:F</span>
              </p>
              <p>
                <br aria-hidden=3D"true">
                 <picture><source type=3D"image/avif" srcset=3D"/images/en-=
us/28f37901-72a8-14c6-6d35-7512cc8802b8?format=3Davif&amp;w=3D320 320w,    =
    /images/en-us/28f37901-72a8-14c6-6d35-7512cc8802b8?format=3Davif&amp;w=
=3D480 480w,        /images/en-us/28f37901-72a8-14c6-6d35-7512cc8802b8?form=
at=3Davif&amp;w=3D640 640w,        /images/en-us/28f37901-72a8-14c6-6d35-75=
12cc8802b8?format=3Davif&amp;w=3D800 800w" sizes=3D"(max-width: 480px) 320p=
x, (max-width: 768px) 480px, (max-width: 1024px) 640px, 800px"><source type=
=3D"image/webp" srcset=3D"/images/en-us/28f37901-72a8-14c6-6d35-7512cc8802b=
8?format=3Dwebp&amp;w=3D320 320w,        /images/en-us/28f37901-72a8-14c6-6=
d35-7512cc8802b8?format=3Dwebp&amp;w=3D480 480w,        /images/en-us/28f37=
901-72a8-14c6-6d35-7512cc8802b8?format=3Dwebp&amp;w=3D640 640w,        /ima=
ges/en-us/28f37901-72a8-14c6-6d35-7512cc8802b8?format=3Dwebp&amp;w=3D800 80=
0w" sizes=3D"(max-width: 480px) 320px, (max-width: 768px) 480px, (max-width=
: 1024px) 640px, 800px"><source type=3D"image/jpeg" srcset=3D"/images/en-us=
/28f37901-72a8-14c6-6d35-7512cc8802b8?format=3Djpeg&amp;w=3D320 320w,      =
  /images/en-us/28f37901-72a8-14c6-6d35-7512cc8802b8?format=3Djpeg&amp;w=3D=
480 480w,        /images/en-us/28f37901-72a8-14c6-6d35-7512cc8802b8?format=
=3Djpeg&amp;w=3D640 640w,        /images/en-us/28f37901-72a8-14c6-6d35-7512=
cc8802b8?format=3Djpeg&amp;w=3D800 800w" sizes=3D"(max-width: 480px) 320px,=
 (max-width: 768px) 480px, (max-width: 1024px) 640px, 800px"><img class=3D"=
fluentImage" src=3D"https://support.microsoft.com/images/en-us/28f37901-72a=
8-14c6-6d35-7512cc8802b8" loading=3D"lazy" alt=3D"Command Prompt with admin=
istrator rights" width=3D"980" style=3D"aspect-ratio: 980/514"></picture>
              </p>
              <p>
                <b class=3D"ocpLegacyBold">Step 3:&nbsp;Replace the corrupt=
ed system file with a known good copy of the file.</b>
              </p>
              <p>Type the following command, and then press ENTER:</p>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"ocpUserInput">Copy &lt;Source_File&gt; &lt;D=
estination&gt;</span>
              </p>
              <p>In the above command, replace the <span class=3D"ocpUserIn=
put">&lt;Source_File&gt;&nbsp;</span>placeholder with the path and file nam=
e of the known good copy of the file on your computer, and replace the <spa=
n class=3D"ocpUserInput">&lt;Destination&gt;</span> placeholder with the pa=
th and file name of the corrupted file.</p>
              <p>Example:</p>
              <p>
                <span class=3D"ocpUserInput">copy E:\temp\jscript.dll C:\wi=
ndows\system32\jscript.dll</span>
              </p>
              <p>If the steps above don't work, you may need to reinstall W=
indows. For more info, see <a href=3D"https://support.microsoft.com/windows=
/recovery-options-in-windows-31ce2444-7de3-818c-d626-e3b5a3024da5" target=
=3D"_blank" class=3D"ocpExternalLink" data-bi-area=3D"bkmk_cbs_log" data-bi=
-type=3D"anchor">Recovery options in Windows</a>.&nbsp;</p>
            </div>
    </div>
          </div>
